### FDS API 테스트 (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### 순서대로 실행하세요. STEP 2에서 받은 토큰을 변수에 붙여넣어야 이후 요청이 동작합니다.

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@userToken  =
@adminToken =


### ====================================================
### STEP 1. 회원가입 (인증 불필요)
### ====================================================

# 정상 가입 → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

###

# 중복 username 재가입 → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

###

# username 빈값 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "pass1234"
}


### ====================================================
### STEP 2. 로그인 → 토큰 발급
### 응답의 "token" 값을 복사해서 위 @userToken / @adminToken 에 붙여넣으세요
### ====================================================

# USER 로그인 → 200 + { "token": "eyJ..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

###

# 비밀번호 오류 → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "wrongPassword"
}


### ====================================================
### STEP 3. 이상거래 탐지 (USER or ADMIN 토큰 필요)
### ====================================================

# 정상 소액 송금 → APPROVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 50000,
  "senderIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}

###

# 고액 송금 (1000만원 이상) → BLOCKED
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 15000000,
  "senderIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}

###

# 차단 IP (192.168.0.x) → BLOCKED
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 50000,
  "senderIp": "192.168.0.100",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}

###

# 고액 + 차단 IP 동시 → BLOCKED (reasons 2개)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 20000000,
  "senderIp": "192.168.0.55",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}

###

# 토큰 없이 요청 → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 50000,
  "senderIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}

###

# 위조 토큰으로 요청 → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.fake.token

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 50000,
  "senderIp": "10.0.0.1",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}


### ====================================================
### STEP 4. 화이트리스트 관리 (ADMIN 토큰만 가능)
### ====================================================

# USER 토큰으로 등록 시도 → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/whitelist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2"
}

###

# ADMIN 토큰으로 등록 → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/whitelist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2"
}

###

# 화이트리스트 등록된 user1→user2 고액+차단IP 송금 → APPROVED (룰 무시)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "senderId": "user1",
  "receiverId": "user2",
  "amount": 99000000,
  "senderIp": "192.168.0.100",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-01T12:00:00"
}


### ====================================================
### STEP 5. 이상탐지 내역 조회 (ADMIN 토큰만 가능)
### ====================================================

# USER 토큰으로 조회 → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fraud-history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

# ADMIN 토큰으로 조회 → 200 (첫 페이지, 기본 크기)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fraud-history
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

# 페이지네이션: 2페이지, 5개씩
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fraud-history?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ====================================================
### STEP 6. ADMIN 계정 생성 (ADMIN 토큰만 가능)
### 주의: 최초 admin 계정은 DB에 직접 삽입 후 로그인해서 @adminToken 을 먼저 채워야 합니다
### ====================================================

# 새 ADMIN 계정 생성 → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "username": "admin2",
  "password": "adminPass1234"
}
